- Gallagher S, Sesek RF, Schall MC, Huangfu R. The Lifting Fatigue Failure Tool
  (LiFFT). Applied Ergonomics. 2017;63:142-150.
- Gallagher S, Schall MC, Sesek RF, Huangfu R. The Distal Upper Extremity Tool
  (DUET). Human Factors. 2018;60(8):1146-1162.
- Bani Hani D, Huangfu R, Sesek R, Schall MC, Davis GA, Gallagher S. Development
  and validation of a cumulative exposure shoulder risk assessment tool based on
  fatigue failure theory. Ergonomics. 2021;64(1):39-54.

